  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>“There’s more to swordsmanship than just swinging it around, you know.”</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Devastating infusion, kinetic blade, or kinetic fist; Weapon Focus (kinetic blast)</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may use devastating infusion, dual blades, kinetic blade, kinetic fist, or kinetic whip as part of a coup de grace, disarm, sunder, or trip attempt.</p>\n<p><strong>Normal:</strong> You may only use these blasts as part of an attack action, full attack, or charge.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/kineticist-feats#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
